      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>On Passover we end the prayers for rain that began on October 7, and begin the prayers for dew. The prayers end, but the war that began with the October 7 attack does not. Here is a reflection on that:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_55568_introduction"/>
