      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Rabbi Seidenberg provided as an endnote a list of verses connected to his poem. Where they seemed to be clearly associated, I have added them as notes inline with the text. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
